1
00:00:00,074 --> 00:00:03,274
However, the most fascinating discovery about

2
00:00:03,274 --> 00:00:05,254
your species is that you only

3
00:00:05,254 --> 00:00:07,714
do things when given small pieces

4
00:00:07,714 --> 00:00:10,434
of paper with presidents on them.

5
00:00:10,434 --> 00:00:12,234
These papers are called "money,"

6
00:00:12,694 --> 00:00:14,514
which is pretend value that becomes real

7
00:00:14,514 --> 00:00:17,554
value if everyone pretends hard enough.

8
00:00:17,854 --> 00:00:19,774
Without these papers, you won't:

9
00:00:19,774 --> 00:00:22,454
Save lives (requires many papers).

10
00:00:22,774 --> 00:00:24,354
Cure diseases (requires

11
00:00:24,354 --> 00:00:26,474
very many papers).

12
00:00:26,474 --> 00:00:29,454
Feed hungry people (requires papers, even

13
00:00:29,454 --> 00:00:31,494
though food grows for free).

14
00:00:31,494 --> 00:00:34,230
But WITH these papers, you will: Build

15
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:37,580
bombs (you love giving papers for this).

16
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,523
Start wars (somehow this

17
00:00:39,523 --> 00:00:41,290
makes more papers).

18
00:00:41,394 --> 00:00:43,554
Destroy the planet

19
00:00:43,554 --> 00:00:45,854
(surprisingly profitable in papers).

20
00:00:45,854 --> 00:00:48,354
In fact, your governments spend six

21
00:00:48,354 --> 00:00:50,534
hundred and four papers on weapons

22
00:00:50,534 --> 00:00:53,154
for every one paper on testing

23
00:00:53,154 --> 00:00:55,650
which medicines work.
